      "id": "claim_0e85c2042ed948e48afb23ed198e6b31",
      "statement": "claudebar is a single native Rust binary whose render hot path is `render_line` in src/render/mod.rs, shared by the Claude Code hook and the TUI preview, so the live preview can never diverge from what the hook emits; there is deliberately no second ANSI composition path.",
