      "statement": "The render pipeline supports two layout modes via the Thresholds layout field: the fixed single-line path (default) and the 'auto' responsive path that greedily wraps segments across up to max_lines lines so each line fits the terminal width minus wrap_margin, falling back to a single line when the terminal width is unknown.",
